      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Every irregularity the system found**, with a plain-language explanation and the evidence. Use the filters at the top (customer, operator, finding type).\n**Source record** = the exact lift or invoice line in the data (row-level audit trail). A finding is a **discrepancy to check, not an accusation** — causes can be the sensor, data gaps or combined truck loads.\nTip: sort the table by **€ at stake** (click the column header)."
      }
